    "title": "Minnesota Early Voting Starts Ahead of 2022 Pace - NewsBreak",
    "text": "21 hours ago Minnesota election officials distributed nearly 385-thousand absentee and mail ballots during the first six days of early voting. Approximately 8,400 voters cast ballots in person, while another 3,900 ballots were returned by mail. The combined total is slightly above the first-week figure from the 2022 election. Updated statewide numbers will... Read full article\n3",
